{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/silverene-towers-palma-holding-dubai-marina","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":385,"crm_id":"1936","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Silverene Towers","slug":"silverene-towers-palma-holding-dubai-marina","display_address":"Dubai Marina","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"TBA","developer":"Palma Holding","price":10500000,"display_price":"10.5M","lattitude":25.0752339,"longitude":55.1371344,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Silverene Towers is the perfect choice for those dreaming of modern and comfortable living in the heart of Dubai Marina. This residential complex, divided into two buildings, embodies luxury and convenience. Tower A, with its 35 floors, and Tower B, consisting of 26 floors, are both connected by a common podium. Silverene encompasses all the benefits of waterfront living, topped by a unique interior treatment and a captivating glass and mirror effect that reflects the blue waters and maximizes the breathtaking view on each floor. There are a mix of <strong>studios, one-, two- and three-bedroom apartments</strong>, duplexes and penthouses.</p><p>The amenities are not limited to just the interior of the apartments. Safety is a priority here, with round-the-clock security and concierge services available 24/7. Residents can use basement parking, and for those who aspire to a healthy lifestyle, the complex features a fitness center and pools for both adults and children. There's also a playground for the little ones.</p><p>Nearby, you'll find the Marsa Dubai bus stop and the DMCC metro station, providing convenient access to any point in the city. And, of course, high-end restaurants like Bazerkan Lebanese Restaurant and La Gaufrette, as well as Carrefour Market supermarket, are located near Silverene Towers. And if you decide to spend a day shopping, Dubai Marina Mall is just a 5-minute walk away. Also it takes roughly 22 minutes to drive to Dubai Mall, 14 minutes to Palm Jumeirah, 20 minutes to Burj Al Arab and 6 minutes to The Walk JBR.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1936/images/2024/05/17/llH2pdXECzzDzIXcDY7Rj026AdgMBuxB5Luvi71z.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/05/17/llH2pdXECzzDzIXcDY7Rj026AdgMBuxB5Luvi71z.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1936/images/2024/05/17/7kV7dSJznVhaavcBnbABnChuNSucIAJAP2uB3o9t.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/05/17/7kV7dSJznVhaavcBnbABnChuNSucIAJAP2uB3o9t.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1936/images/2024/05/17/bgGFA2aTCk2sF4GSXiAaBb2wEuuAsszIVFchLVD6.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/05/17/bgGFA2aTCk2sF4GSXiAaBb2wEuuAsszIVFchLVD6.png","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1936/images/2024/05/17/V7ynR1JtNMbD5mRHJdgvzwjEujoUNVuw7qZiQHSQ.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/05/17/V7ynR1JtNMbD5mRHJdgvzwjEujoUNVuw7qZiQHSQ.png","__ggfxIndex":3}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2201,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1445,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":2003,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":2004,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":2005,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null